# Backup/temp artifacts. `make lock-check` writes requirements-*.txt.bak
# before regenerating, and an interrupted run leaves them behind — where a
# `git add -A` will happily commit them and fail check_repo_hygiene.py.
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
